{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t央視新聞報道，國家主席習近平將在深圳，會見來華出席亞太經合組職領導人非正式會議的俄羅斯總統普京。<br/>\n<br/>\n另外，普京出席亞太經合組職工商領導人峰會並發言。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:59:06.903313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:34:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:37:40.696647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:40.078429+00:00","content_hash":"57694bab0f6083f199a8348b7f163dfe07ee7886dfa7e64397a13553af487f65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}